  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.22: paged Avalonia preview. #79: adds PagedAvaloniaRenderer and PageLayoutOptions to AdocNet.Avalonia — a print-like preview that flows content into fixed-size pages (A4/Letter presets, plus FromPdfPoints to mirror a PdfRenderOptions geometry) without a PDF-rasterizer dependency; RenderPages returns one Border per page and inline source ranges are preserved, so click-to-source still works. Pagination is at block granularity by on-screen measurement, so it approximates rather than matches PDF page breaks. Also adds PageBreakLayout to AdocNet.Layout: LayoutBuilder no longer drops explicit '<<<' page breaks (continuous renderers still ignore them, so existing consumers are unaffected). See CHANGELOG.md.",
